      "content": "For your group, the most critical step is to clarify if the layovers require you to officially \"enter\" the country or are merely transit points. Typically, very brief airside transit doesn't require a visa, but if you leave the airport, a full entry visa for Singapore, Vietnam, and Thailand will be necessary. Always check the latest regulations for each country's specific requirements based on your passport nationality before booking travel.",
      "source": "target",
